Description: Add the local +y7001 changelog entry
 Document the damage clip clamp and the carried touch fix in the
 package changelog so the built binaries carry the local version.
Origin: local
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+mutter (50.1-0ubuntu2.5+y7001) resolute; urgency=medium
+
+  * Clamp KMS damage clips to the framebuffer bounds. The kernel rejects
+    negative damage coordinates with -EINVAL, which caused page flip
+    failures on window transitions at the screen edge.
+  * wayland/touch: Do not crash on an empty focus surface. This carries the
+    local touch-resize fix that was previously installed on the Y700.
+
+ -- yiyang-dev <yiyang-dev@localhost>  Wed, 12 Nov 2026 21:45:00 +0800
+
 mutter (50.1-0ubuntu2.5) resolute; urgency=medium
 
   * d/p/u: Fix alt-tab with sloppy/mouse window focus-mode.
